<title>CORMAS</title>
<meta name="description" content="Applied modelling of the environment and natural resources. It presents CIRAD scientists and their partners work on multi-agent systems and on management of renewable natural 
resources. A simulation computer program (CORMAS) can be downloaded. Application examples with a  models library and publications. Training courses are also offered. The site aims to facilitate   networking.">
