        <li><span style="" lang="EN-US">Download
the model (</span><a href="file:///C:/temp/Pierre/web/..%5Clogiciel%5CDinamicaParcelariaPigue.zip"><span style="" lang="EN-US">zipfile</span></a><span style="" lang="EN-US">, 7Ko), download the UML
diagrams (<a href="file:///C:/temp/Pierre/web/dinParcel/Pigue.xml.zip">Pigue.xml.zip</a>,
MagicDraw)</span></li>
        <li><span style="" lang="EN-US">For more
information, </span><a href="mailto:bommel@cirad.fr"><span style="" lang="EN-US">contact the authors</span></a><span style="" lang="EN-US">.&nbsp;</span></li>
      </ul>
<!--#include virtual="/include/copyright_fr.inc" -->
	</td>

  <td bgcolor="#ffffff" valign="top" width="15"> 
   
      <div class="texte" align="right"></div>

  </td>

 </tr>

  </tbody>
</table>

</body>
