 <p>&nbsp;</p>

      <h1>Posters</h1>

      <p><b><i><font color="#666666" size="4">2006</font></i></b></p>
      <p>Guechtouli W. Learning in a community of practice: an agent-based model. 
        GREQAM, University of Aix-Marseille III. Poster presented at the first 
        World Congress on Social Simulation (WCSS06), Aug. 21-26, Kyoto, Japan. 
        <a href="/pdf/posterWidad2006.pdf" target="_blank"><img src="/images/renvoi.gif" width="16" height="16" border="0"></a></p>
      <p><b><i><font color="#666666" size="4">2005</font></i></b></p>
      <p>Barnaud C., Promburom P., Promburom T., Tr&eacute;buil G. and F. Bousquet. 
        2005. Companion Modelling to Support Adaptive Watershed Management in 
        Northern Thailand Highlands. IRRI-Cirad-DOA Project, Bangkok, Thailand; 
        Paris X-Nanterre University, France; Chiang-Mai University, Thailand. 
        <a href="/pdf/posterMaeSalaep.pdf" target="_blank"><img src="/images/renvoi.gif" width="16" height="16" border="0"></a></p>
      <p>Bazile D., Dembele S., Le Page C. 2005. Co-construction de r&egrave;gles collectives de gestion pour le maintien  in situ de la biodiversit&eacute; des c&eacute;r&eacute;ales en Afrique de lOuest. Conf&eacute;rence  Internationale &laquo;&nbsp;Biodiversit&eacute; : science et gouvernance&nbsp;&raquo;. Paris,  France, 24-28 janvier 2005. <a href="http://cormas.cirad.fr/pdf/posterSorghoMali_2005.pdf" target="_blank"><img src="/images/renvoi.gif" width="16" height="16" border="0"></a></p>
      <p>Mathevet R.,  Le Page C., Etienne M., Lefebvre G., Poulin B., Mauchamp A. 2005. Le jeu de r&ocirc;le  ButorStar comme outil de sensibilisation et daide &agrave; la gestion collective des  roseli&egrave;res. Colloque International &laquo;&nbsp;Mod&eacute;lisations &agrave; l&rsquo;interface entre  Natures et Soci&eacute;t&eacute;s&nbsp;&raquo;. 7-9 d&eacute;cembre 2005, Montpellier, France. <a href="http://cormas.cirad.fr/pdf/posterButorStar_2005_fr.pdf" target="_blank"><img src="/images/renvoi.gif" width="16" height="16" border="0"></a></p>
      <p>Vejpas C., Bousquet F., Naivinit W., Tr&eacute;buil G. et Srisombat N. 
        2005. Participatory modeling for managing rice varieties and seed system 
        in lower northeast Thailand. IRRI-Cirad-DOA Project, Bangkok et Universit&eacute; 
        dUbon Ratchathani, Thaïlande. Poster pr&eacute;sent&eacute; a la conf&eacute;rence internationale 
        Biodiversit&eacute;: science et gouvernance, 24-28 janvier 2005, Paris. <a href="/pdf/posterUbon.pdf" target="_blank"><img src="/images/renvoi.gif" width="16" height="15" border="0"></a></p>
      <p><b><i><font color="#666666" size="4">2004</font></i></b></p>
      <p> Gurung T.R., Ekasingh B., Ekasingh M., Bousquet F. et Tr&eacute;buil 
        G. 2004. Companion modeling to improve irrigation water sharing among 
        rice growers in west-central Bhutan. IRRI-Cirad-DOA Project, Bangkok, 
        Ministere de lagriculture, Thimphu, Bhoutan, et Universit&eacute; de Chiang 
        Maï, Thaïlande. <a href="/pdf/posterBhutan.pdf" target="_blank"><img src="/images/renvoi.gif" width="16" height="15" border="0"></a></p>
      <p><b><i><font color="#666666" size="4">2003</font></i></b></p>
      <p> Lacombe G., Phupak S., Bousquet F., Naivinit W., Kuper M., Vejpas C., 
        Boonmun C. et Tr&eacute;buil G. 2003. A Multi-Agent Model to Help Managing 
        Rainfall Variability in the Rainfed Lowland Rice Ecosystem of Northeast 
        Thailand. IRRI-Cirad-DOA Project, Bangkok, et Universit&eacute; dUbon Ratchathani, 
        Thaïlande. Poster pr&eacute;sent&eacute; a la conference internationale SIMMOD, 17-19 
        janvier 2005, Nakhon Pathom, Thaïlande. <a href="/pdf/posterLamDomYai.pdf" target="_blank"><img src="/images/renvoi.gif" width="16" height="15" border="0"></a></p>
      <p>Promburom P., Ekasingh M., Shinawatra-Ekasingh B., Saengchyoswat C., 
        Bousquet F. et Tr&eacute;buil G. 2003. Integrated Participatory Multi-Agent 
        Systems (MAS) Modeling for Collective Watershed Management in the Highlands 
        of Northern Thailand. IRRI-Cirad-DOA Project et Universit&eacute; de Chiang Maï, 
        Thaïlande. Poster pr&eacute;sent&eacute; a la premiere conf&eacute;rence de l "European Social 
        Simulation Association" (ESSA), septembre 2003, Gröningen, Pays-Bas. <a href="/pdf/posterMaehae.jpg" target="_blank"><img src="/images/renvoi.gif" width="16" height="15" border="0"></a></p>
      <p>Bousquet F. et Tr&eacute;buil G. 2003. Interdisciplinary Training on 
        Multi-Agent Systems (MAS), Social Sciences and Integrated Natural Resource 
        Management (INRM) in Thailand. IRRI-Cirad-DOA Project, Bangkok, Thaïlande. 
        Poster pr&eacute;sent&eacute; a la premiere conf&eacute;rence de l "European Social Simulation 
        Association" (ESSA), septembre 2003, Gröningen, Pays-Bas. <a href="/pdf/posterMasCourses.pdf" target="_blank"><img src="/images/renvoi.gif" width="16" height="15" border="0"></a></p>
      <p>Suphanchaimart N., Bousquet F., Wongsamun C., Patamadit I., Panthong 
        P. et Tr&eacute;buil G. 2003. Companion modeling to understand the expansion 
