  <body border="0" onload="MM_preloadImages(/images/en/accueil_r.gif,/images/en/demarche_r.gif,/images/en/logiciel_r.gif,/images/en/applications_r.gif,/images/en/biblio_r.gif,/images/en/formation_r.gif,/images/en/reseaux_r.gif)"
    topmargin="0"
    marginwidth="0"
    marginheight="0"
    leftmargin="0"
    bgcolor="#FFFFFF">
    <!--#include virtual="haut.inc" -->
    <table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <!--#include virtual="sommair.inc" -->
          <td width="*" valign="top" bgcolor="#FFFFFF">
            <p>&nbsp;</p>
            <h1>List of all the Cormas models</h1>
            <h2>Alphabetical order</h2>
            <p>[<a href="ABSTRACT.htm" target="_blank">ABSTRACT</a>] : Agent
              Based Simulation Tool for Resource Allocation in a CatchmenT in
              Brazil (<a href="mailto:P.R.vanOel@ctw.utwente.nl">Pieter van Oel</a>).</p>
            <p>[<a href="../../fr/applica/alamo.htm">Alamo</a>] Agricultural
              Landscape Modelling. Politiques publiques agricoles et forestieres
              et transformation des paysages des Grands Causses au Sud du Massif
              central (<a href="mailto:Annie.Hofstetter@supagro.inra.fr">A.
                Hofstetter</a>, <a href="mailto:lifran@ensam.inra.fr">R. Lifran</a>).
              </p>
            <p>[<a href="amaz.htm">Amaz</a>] Comparing different strategies of
              land use and their consequences in terms of Environmental Services
              in the Amazon (<a href="mailto:bommel@cirad.fr">P. Bommel</a>)</p>
            <p>[<a href="../../fr/applica/atollGame.htm">AtollGame</a>] : Jeu de
              rôles pour mettre en lumiere la complexit&eacute; du probleme des
              r&eacute;serves deau potable sur latoll de Tarawa dans le Pacifique Sud
              (R&eacute;p. de Kiribati), dans le but de g&eacute;n&eacute;rer des propositions
              collectives pour une am&eacute;lioration de la gestion des eaux
              souterraines <font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif">(<a
                  href="mailto:anne_dray@yahoo.fr">A.
                  Dray</a>, P. Perez, P. dAquino)</font>.</p>
            <p>[<a href="aware.htm">AWARE</a>] : Agent-based Watershed Analyses
              for Resource and Economic Sustainability in South Africa (<a href="mailto:sfarolfi@postino.up.ac.za">Stefano
                Farolfi</a>).</p>
            <img src="/images/applica/espaceFeu.gif" alt="Linterface dAutomateFeu"
              hspace="10"
              height="164"
              width="254"
              vspace="10"
              align="right">
            <p>[AgentsJeux] : tragedy of the commons and prisoners dilemna <font
                face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif">(<a
                  href="mailto:bousquet@cirad.fr">Francois
                  Bousquet</a> and <a href="mailto:lepage@cirad.fr">Christophe
                  Le Page</a>)</font>.</p>
            <p>[AutomateVote] : electoral ballot <font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif">(<a
                  href="mailto:bousquet@cirad.fr">Francois
                  Bousquet</a> and <a href="mailto:lepage@cirad.fr">Christophe
                  Le Page</a>)</font>.</p>
            <p>[<a href="bohol.htm">Bohol</a>] : Natural Resource Management of
              the Municipality of Loon in Bohol, Philippines (<a href="mailto:paoloppa@yahoo.com">Paolo
                Campo</a>).</p>
            <p>[<a href="broutelaforet.htm">BrouteLaForet</a>] : spatial
              representations and interactions between individuals, space and
              society <font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif">(<a href="mailto:Jean-Luc.Bonnefoy@aixup.univ-aix.fr">Jean-Luc
                  Bonnefoy</a>)</font>.</p>
            <p>[<a href="/en/applica/burkina.htm">Burkina</a>] : soil quality
              indicators in Burkina Faso <font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif">(<a
                  href="mailto:serge.guillobez@cirad.fr">Serge
                  Guillobez</a>)</font>.</p>
            <p>[<a href="../../fr/applica/butorStar.htm">ButorStar</a>] : Jeu de
              rôles pour sensibiliser les &eacute;tudiants a la conservation de
              lavifaune et a lusage rationnel et raisonn&eacute; des roselieres, mais
              &eacute;galement destin&eacute; a fournir le support dune r&eacute;flexion collective
              aux usagers pour une gestion durable de leur roseliere <font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif">(<a
                  href="mailto:raphael.mathevet@cefe.cnrs.fr">R.
                  Mathevet </a>, C. Le Page, M. Etienne, G. Lefebvre, S.
                Pror&eacute;ol, B. Poulin, G. Gigot, A. Mauchamp)</font>.</p>
            <p>[<a href="catchscape.htm">CatchScape</a>] : River bassins
              management in north Thaïland (<a href="mailto:nicolas_becu@yahoo.com"><font
                  face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif">Nicolas
                  Becu</font></a><font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif">,
                <a href="mailto:pascal.perez@cirad.fr">Pascal Perez</a>, Andrew
                Walker</font>)<br>
              <br>
              [<a href="cienaga.htm">Cienaga</a>] : Water quantity and quality
              of the Ci&eacute;naga dam, Jujuy, Argentina <font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif">(<a
                  href="mailto:gregoire.leclerc@cirad.fr">Gr&eacute;goire
                  Leclerc</a> et </font><font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif"><font
                  face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif"><a
                    href="mailto:bommel@cirad.fr">Pierre
                    Bommel</a></font>)</font>. </p>
            <p>[<a href="conway.htm">Conway</a>] : the game of life <font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif">(<a
                  href="mailto:bousquet@cirad.fr">Francois
                  Bousquet</a> and <a href="mailto:lepage@cirad.fr">Christophe
                  Le Page</a>)</font>.<br>
              <br>
              [<a href="../../en/applica/contamicuenca.htm">ContaMiCuenca</a>] :
              Game for water management in Guanacaste, Costa Rica <font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif">(Spanish
                version. <a href="mailto:gregoire.leclerc@cirad.fr">Gr&eacute;goire
                  Leclerc</a> et </font><font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif"><font
                  face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif"><a
                    href="mailto:bommel@cirad.fr">Pierre
                    Bommel</a></font>)</font>.</p>
            <p>[<a href="Cosmos.htm">Cosmos</a>] : A spatially explicit model to
              simulate the epidemiology of <i>Cosmopolites sordidus</i> in
              banana fields <font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif">(<a
                  href="mailto:vinatier@cirad.fr">Fabrice
                  Vinatier</a>)</font>.</p>
            <p>[DataBase] : Cormas configuration for exchanges with Access
              databases by ODBC <font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif">(<a
                  href="mailto:sboissau@fpt.vn">Stanislas
                  Boissau</a>)</font>. <font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif"></font><br>
              <br>
              [<a href="demo_aggregates.htm"><span style="color: #0000ee;">Demo_Aggregates</span></a>]
              Generating spatial aggregates in Cormas (<a href="mailto:bommel@cirad.fr">P.
                Bommel</a>).</p>
            <p> [<a href="demoAquifer.htm"><span style="color: #0000ee;">Demo_Aquifer</span></a>]
              The ground water diffusion in an aquifer (<a href="mailto:bommel@cirad.fr">P.
                Bommel</a>)</p>
            <p>[<a href="didy.htm">Didy</a>] : multiple uses of a forest
              ecosystem in Madagascar <font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif">(<a
                  href="mailto:geraldine.abrami@cirad.fr">G&eacute;raldine
                  Abrami</a>)</font>.</p>
            <p>[<a href="diffuse.htm">Diffuse</a>] : A simple model of pheromone
              diffusion by ants <font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif">(<a
                  href="mailto:bommel@cirad.fr">Pierre
                  Bommel</a>)</font>.</p>
            <p>[<a href="../../fr/applica/dinParcel.htm">DinamicaParcelas</a>] :
              Dynamics of the Landuse in the Pampa <font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif">(in
                french... <a href="mailto:corral@fing.edu.uy">Jorge Corral</a>,
                <a href="mailto:bommel@cirad.fr">Pierre Bommel</a>)</font>.</p>
            <p>[<a href="djemiong.htm">Djemiong</a>] : hunting of wild meat in
              Cameroun <font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif">(<a
                  href="mailto:lepage@cirad.fr">Christophe
                  Le Page</a>, <a href="mailto:bousquet@cirad.fr">Francois
                  Bousquet</a> and <a href="mailto:ibakam@yahoo.com">Innocent
                  Bakam</a>)</font>.</p>
            <p>[<a href="dps.htm">Dps</a>] : spatialized prisoners dilemna <font
                face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif">(<a
                  href="mailto:lepage@cirad.fr">Christophe
                  Le Page</a> and <a href="mailto:bousquet@cirad.fr">Francois
                  Bousquet</a>)</font>.</p>
            <p>[<a href="dricol.htm">Dricol</a>] : emergence of resource-sharing
              conventions <font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif">(<a
                  href="mailto:olivier.thebaud@ifremer.fr">Olivier
                  Th&eacute;baud</a> and <a href="mailto:locatelli@cirad.fr">Bruno
                  Locatelli</a>)</font>.<br>
              <br>
