      <p>Attributes of the vegetation. </p>
      <p>Each attribute starting with <em><strong>mesXX</strong></em> is an array containing the necessary working days distributed on the 12 months of the year.</p>
      <p>Attributes name ending with <strong><em>CQ</em></strong> are for With Fire (Com Queimada), and with <em><strong>SQ</strong></em> are for Without Fire (Sem Queimada). Example: custoSuprimirCQ = suppress cost With Fire and custoSuprimirSQ = suppress cost Without Fire.</p>
