      <h1>Our Research Team</h1>

      <p>Within the project Green created in 1993, researchers of different disciplines 

        are working on resource management and environment.In this unit, modelling 

        has become a major research subject, under the guidance of Fran&ccedil;ois 

        Bousquet. </p>

