            <p> </p>
            <h1>Transport and Transfers to Cirad - Baillarguet </h1>
            <p>See the <a href="maps.htm">maps</a> of Cirad and a list of <a href="hotel.htm">hotels</a>.</p>
            <br>
            <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="98%">
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td rowspan="3" width="15">&nbsp;</td>
                  <td valign="top" width="743">
                    <h2><b>By plane ...</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </h2>
                    <p>Airport Transfers : <a href="http://www.montpellier.aeroport.fr/">Montpellier-M&eacute;diterran&eacute;e
                        International Airport</a> is 15 min. from the town
                      centre and 15 km from the CIRAD. <br>
                      <br>
                      * 14 daily return flights to Paris-Roissy Charles de
                      Gaulle (CDG) and Paris-Orly-Ouest (ORY) - 1 h 10 min.
                      flight time. <br>
                      * 1 daily return flight from London (Gatwick) - 1 h 30
                      min. flight time. <br>
                      * Direct connections to Ajaccio, Bastia, Bordeaux, Lille,
                      Lyon, Nantes, Nice, Perpignan, Rennes, Strasbourg .. <br>
                      * Direct international connections to Copenhagen, London,
                      Madrid, Rome, Vienne... <br>
                      <br>
                      Information available on <a href="http://www.airfrance.com/us">Air
                        France</a> website Airport </p>
                    <br>
                  </td>
