                      height="69"
                      width="201"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td valign="top">
                    <h2><b>By train ...</b></h2>
                    <p>The <a>SNCF</a> railway station is located in the town
                      centre. 10 daily links to Paris - 3 h 15 min. by TGV (High
                      Speed Train). <br>
                      * direct SNCF links with Barcelona, Geneva and Milan. <br>
                      * direct TGV links to Montpellier from the airports of
                      Paris-Roissy-Charles de Gaulle (CDG), Lille and Lyon-Saint
                      Exup&eacute;ry. </p>
                    <p>Information available on <a href="http://www.sncf.com/indexe.htm">SNCF
                        website</a></p>
                  </td>
