                    <h2><b><font color="#ff9900">Transferts</font></b> </h2>
                    <h2> Travel to CIRAD-Lavalette by public transport </h2>
                    <p>From the SNCF railway station, take the tram marked
                      "Mosson", get off at the "Saint Eloi" stop and take the
                      bus "La Navette" from the "Saint Eloi" stop in rue du
                      Docteur Pezet. Get off at the last stop, "Agropolis
                      Lavalette", cross over avenue Agropolis and walk for
                      another 200 m. The journey takes 30 minutes from the
                      station. </p>
                    <p> Ticket price : Single Ticket :1,10 euros, 10 tickets :
                      9,30 euros. Tickets can be bought from automatic machines
                      with coins or credit cards. </p>
                    <h2>Travel to CIRAD-Baillarguet by public transport </h2>
                    <p>From the main station (SNCF) inMONTPELLIER, your travel
                      will last around 41 minutes.</p>
