<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%">

<tr>

    <!--#include virtual="sommair.inc" --> 

    <td width="*" valign="top" bgcolor="#FFFFFF"> 

 <p>&nbsp;</p>

      <h1>Registration to the Training Courses</h1>

      <p>&nbsp;</p>

      <h2>Session &quot;Introduction to Cormas&quot;</h2>

      <p>The next session will be held in France (Montpellier), <font color="#FF0000"><strong>May 
        17 - 21, 2010</strong></font> (see the <a href="/pdf/planningCormasCourse_2010-05.pdf" target="_blank">program</a>).To 
        register to this session (in english by a french trainer), download the 
        <a href="/pdf/RegFormCormasCourse_2010-05.pdf" target="_blank">registration 
        form</a>, then when completed, send it to the address given in the form.</p>

      <h2>Session &quot;Advanced Agent-Based Modelling with Cormas&quot;</h2>

      <p>The next session will be held in France (Montpellier), <font color="#FF0000"><strong></strong></font> 
        <font color="#FF0000"><strong>July 12 - 21, 2010</strong></font>. The 
        program is under construction. Morning sessions will be based on tutorials 
        to improve command of the Cormas platform while during the afternoon sessions, 
        trainees will work on their own model. The last day (Wednesday 21st July), 
        these models will be presented / discussed. To register to this session 
        (in english by french trainers), download the<a href="/pdf/formulaireInscription.pdf" target="_blank"></a><a href="/pdf/RegFormCormasCourse_2010-07.pdf" target="_blank"> 
        registration form</a>, then when completed, send it to the address given 
        in the form.</p>

      <p>&nbsp;</p>

      <!--#include virtual="/include/copyright_en.inc" -->

	</td>

    <td width="15" valign="top" bgcolor="#FFFFFF"> 

    <div align="right" class="texte"></div>

    </td>

