    <!--#include virtual="sommair.inc" -->

    <td width="*" valign="top" bgcolor="#FFFFFF"> 

      <p>&nbsp;</p>

      <h1>Designing, Implementing and Running <br>
        Agent-Based Models for Renewable Resources Management<br>
      </h1>

      <p>&nbsp;</p>
      <p>This is to announce a summer school on Designing, Implementing and Running 
        Agent-Based Models for Renewable Resources Management, which will take 
        place at Cirad in Montpellier from September 5-16 2011. All people contacted 
        at this stage are kindly requested to distribute this information to any 
        person potentially interested in attending. <br>
        <b>The week after the summer school, the <a href="http://www.essa2011.org" target="_blank">7th 
        European Social Simulation Association Conference</a> will take place 
        in Montpellier</b>.<br>
      </p>
      <h2>Content</h2>
      <p>During the morning sessions, the principles, methods and technics of 
        the design, implementation and exploration stages will be collectively 
        taught. An existing and well-documented model will be replicated as a 
        practical exercise. Specific points will be addressed according to the 
        expectations and demands of the participants.</p>
      <p>The afternoon sessions will be devoted to personal applications: the 
        trainers will support the participants in designing and fine-tuning their 
        own agent-based model. </p>
      <h2>Tools</h2>
      <p>Specific time slots will be allocated to teach the graphical language 
        UML as well as the generic platforms Cormas and Mimosa.</p>
      <h2>Trainers</h2>
      <p>Nicolas Becu (CNRS-Prodig), Pierre Bommel, Fran&ccedil;ois Bousquet, 
        Christophe Le Page, Jean-Pierre M&uuml;ller (Cirad-Green) </p>
      <h2>Registration</h2>
      <p>Enquiries and registration applications <a href="RegFormSept2011.doc" target="_blank"><img src="../../images/doc.jpg" width="16" height="16" border="0" align="absbottom"></a> 
        must be sent to <a href="mailto:le_page@cirad.fr">Christophe Le Page</a>.</p>
      <p>&nbsp;</p>
      <!--#include virtual="/include/copyright_en.inc" -->

    </td>



    <td width="15"   valign="top" bgcolor="#FFFFFF"> 



    <div align="right" class="texte"></div>



    </td>



  </tr>



</table>



</body>



</html>



