</script> </head>
  <body topmargin="0" leftmargin="0" border="0" onload="MM_preloadImages(/images/en/accueil_r.gif,/images/en/demarche_r.gif,/images/en/logiciel_r.gif,/images/en/applications_r.gif,/images/en/biblio_r.gif,/images/en/formation_r.gif,/images/en/reseaux_r.gif)"
    bgcolor="#FFFFFF"
    marginheight="0"
    marginwidth="0">
    <!--#include virtual="haut.inc" -->
    <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <!--#include virtual="sommair.inc" -->
          <td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" valign="top" width="*">
            <h1><br>
              VW 7.6nc (nc for Non-Commercial!)<br>
              <img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcSbT98Is3PKjBckoofK8ccda3g9xgidounRRibcfhkfwIMtsH4l"
                data-height="88"
                data-width="168"
                id="rg_hi"
                alt=""
                height="88"
                width="168"><br>
            </h1>
            <div>
              <div>
                <h2>Download VisualWorks</h2>
              </div>
              <p>Cormas has been developped with the non-commercial version of <a
                  href="http://www.cincomsmalltalk.com/main/developer-community/trying-cincom-smalltalk/try-cincom-smalltalk/"
                  target="_new">VisualWorks</a>®
                from <em>Cincom Systems, </em>which is therefore needed to be
                installed on your computer.</p>
              <p>If you commit not using Cormas for commercial purposes (please,
                visite the <a style="font-weight: bold;" target="_top" href="http://www.cincomsmalltalk.com/main/developer-community/trying-cincom-smalltalk/personal-use-license/">Personal
                  Use License</a> of Cincom), you can download <b>VW7.6nc</b>
                (nc is for Non-Commercial!) directly from Cormas website: </p>
              <table border="0">
                <tbody>
                  <tr>
                    <td height="68" width="179">Version for Windows:</td>
                    <td width="220"><b><a href="../../../logiciel/vw7.6/vw7.6nc_Windows_com.zip"
                          target="_blank">vw7.6nc</a></b><a
                        href="../../../logiciel/vw7.6/vw7.6nc_Windows_com.zip">
                        (version Windows)</a></td>
                    <td width="231"><img src="../../../images/outil/logo-windows.gif"
                        alt="windows"
                        height="40"
                        width="160"></td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td height="67">Version for Mac OSX:</td>
                    <td><b><a href="../../../logiciel/vw7.6/vw7.6nc_MacLinux.zip"
                          target="_blank">vw7.6nc</a></b><a
                        href="../../../logiciel/vw7.6/vw7.6nc_MacLinux.zip">
                        (version Mac OS X) </a></td>
                    <td><i><img src="../../../images/outil/mac_logo2.gif" alt=""
                          height="31"
                          width="69"></i></td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td>Version for Linux:</td>
                    <td><b><a href="../../../logiciel/vw7.6/vw7.6nc_MacLinux.zip"
                          target="_blank">vw7.6nc</a></b><a
                        href="../../../logiciel/vw7.6/vw7.6nc_MacLinux.zip">
                        (version Linux)</a></td>
                    <td><img data-height="232" data-width="200" src="../../../images/outil/linux-logo"
                        id="rg_hi2"
                        alt=""
                        height="75"
                        width="69"></td>
                  </tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
              <p>You can unzip the file directlyon the root of your hard drive.
              </p>
              <p>Alternatively, download the <a href="../../../logiciel/vw7.6/CST08NC_mar08.1.iso">
                  iso CD of 7.6nc</a>.</p>
              <h3>&nbsp;Making movies</h3>
              <p>To snap the grid or make movies (only available on Windows), it
                is necessary to install <a href="http://www.apple.com/fr/quicktime/download/"
                  target="_blank">QuickTime.
                  </a>Then you need to download the DLL file (<a href="../../../logiciel/cormas2004/JunWinQT.dll">JunWinQT.dll</a>)
                on Disk:\VW7.6\bin\win</p>
            </div>
            <h3>Instal Cormas </h3>
            <div> Go back to the <a href="install.htm">Cormas installation page</a></div>
            <!--#include virtual="/include/copyright_fr.inc" --> </td>
          <td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" valign="top" width="15"> <br>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
