      <p> 
      <h1> Bugs and add-on of Cormas2002 - beta</h1>
      <h2>&nbsp;</h2>
      <p>The next array describes the bugs list and defaults of Cormas2002 - beta. 
        Some of them have been corrected; their are also presented with a file.st 
        that can be downloaded and integrated in Cormas by the &quot;File in&quot; 
        method . Further explanations can be <a href="file_in.htm">found here</a>. 
      </p>
      <p>On the web site, the beta version of Cormas always includes the last 
        modifications. </p>
      <h2>Bugs</h2>
      <div align="center"> 
        <table width="100%" border="1">
          <tr bgcolor="#FF6633"> 
