    <!--#include virtual="sommair.inc" -->
    <td width="*" valign="top" bgcolor="#FFFFFF"> <p>&nbsp; 
      <h1>Downloading Cormas</h1>
      <h2>Last step: access to files </h2>
      <ul>
        <li>If you have never installed Cormas on the VisualWorks, you should 
          go to 
          <ul>
            <li>the full<a href="fullInstal.htm"> install page for Windows <img src="../../images/outil/logo-windows.gif" width="135" height="33"></a> 
              <br>
              <br>
              or </li>
            <li>the full <a href="fullInstalMAC.htm">install page for Mac OS X 
              <i><img src="../../images/outil/mac_logo2.gif" width="69" height="31"></i> 
              or Linux <img src="../../images/outil/logomed.128" width="80" height="32"><br>
              </a> </li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li>If you have already installed Cormas and VisualWorks, you just need 
          to upgrade Cormas to get the last version.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We encourage you to <a href="../reseaux/forumCormas.htm">join</a> the 
        Cormas forum (Cormas@cirad.fr).</p>
      <h2></h2>
      <p>You may also see the new <a href="whatNew.htm" target="_blank">characteristics 
        of Cormas2004</a></p>
      <p>&nbsp;</p>
      <!--#include virtual="/include/copyright_en.inc" --> </td>
