 <p>&nbsp;
      <h1>Publications</h1>
      <p><br>
        Publications presented here were written by researchers of our team and 
        of the Cormas community.
      <p>We will provide progressively an access to downloadable full-text references. 
        Already downloadable references are shown by a symbol <img src="/images/renvoi.gif" width="18" height="18" alt="renvoi"> 
        (link toward a file or another web site). Some references are available 
        in pdf format, but are not donwloadable because of copyright restriction 
        : you may request it by email <img src="/images/mail.gif" width="17" height="17" align="absbottom"></p>
      <p>Files are under pdf format and can be read with Acrobat Reader. If you 
        dont have Acrobat Reader, you can download it in Adobe Web site (in <a href="http://www.adobe.fr/products/acrobat/readstep.html" target="_blank">french</a> 
        or in <a href="http://www.adobe.com/products/acrobat/readstep2.html" target="_blank">english</a>).</p>
      <p>A search engine within a bibliographic database will be soon available. 
        For the moment, bibliographic lists are given as follows:</p>
