                  height="15"
                  width="15"></a></p>
            <p>Rouchier, J. et Bousquet, F. 1998. Non-merchant Economy and
              multi-agents systems, an analysis of structuring exchanges.
              Lecture Notes in Artificial Intelligence 1534: 11-124 (MABS 1998,
              editors: J. Sichman, R. Conte and N. Gilbert).</p>
            <p><b><i><font color="#666666" size="4">1994</font></i></b></p>
            <p>Bousquet, F., Cambier, C. et P. Morand. 1994. Distributed
              artificial intelligence and object-oriented modelling of a
              fishery. Mathematical Computer Modelling, 2018:97-107.</p>
            <p><b><i><font color="#666666" size="4">1993</font></i></b></p>
            <p>Bousquet, F., Morand P., Quensiere J., Mullon C. et A. Pav&eacute;.
              1993. Simulating the interaction between a society and a renewable
              resource. Journal of Biological Systems, 1:199-214.</p>
            <p>&nbsp;</p>
